
#basePath Chapter11

::OnContractSelectOpenCh11
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Player}   Hey, MA...
{@Player}   Oh, yeah. I'm alone...
{@Player}   Kind of my fault, I guess.
{@Player}   What was I thinking? Now I gotta do all this?
{@Player}   Those bots were just slowing me down... Right?

::AfterResearchCh11
@trigger 
@when           IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

// Callie calls

{@Callie}   Hey, Clacky! How's that clunker of a ship? Heard you're all alone out there!
