::AfterSupplyChainCh11
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once

// Incoming call from Blaze

{@Blaze}   Locke! Have you heard? People all over the sector are disconnecting their Frontier software!
{@Player}   How are they getting the bots to work without it?
{@Blaze}   Well, Keela and I have been up to a little something.
{@Blaze}   She's giving her original software away to everyone. Free. Open.
{@Player}   Keela? So... that was her plan all along?
{@Blaze}   And now I'm ripping out all those cheap parts and giving these bots some real upgrades!
{@Player}   Of course you are, Blaze.
{@Player}   You sound busy.
{@Blaze}   Fewer units, sure. But at least they'll be safe!
{@Player}   And the company owners on Kalvis are okay with this?
{@Blaze}   Ha! We're not giving them much choice!
{@Blaze}   Now that they aren't under Frontier's thumb, they're have not excuse not to negotiate.

